	(text "Phrase Countdown Light\n+5V = USB VBUS passed through the XIAO 5V pin.\nU2 gate 1 shifts GPIO10 (3.3 V) to 5 V; AHCT reads >2.0 V as high. Spare gates 2-4 disabled (OE high, A low).\nR1 sits at the U2 end of the data wire. C1 mounts at the ring's power pads, C2 at U2 pin 14.\nSW1 uses GPIO3's internal pull-up. GPIO2/8/9 are ESP32-C3 strapping pins and stay unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
